X:5798
T:Humors of Castelcomer
R:jig
H:This tune came from Maureen Glynn.  She got it as sheet music from the
H:kitchen table of Paddy O'brien while she (and others) were paying their
H:last respects.  He died shortly in the next room.  According to
H:Maureen, the handwriten music was in a stack of music about a foot
H:high.
