X:5946
T:I See the Moon
B:Joyce, P. W.; "Old Irish Folk Music and Songs"
R:song
H:On the first appearance of the new moon, a number of children linked
H:hands and danced, keeping time to the following verse:
W:I see the moon, the moon sees me,
