Cat Faber's Songs in ABC notationCat Faber's Songs in ABC notation
How to use this file: Save as a text file (ASCII) with a name something like
"FABER.ABC" (the .ABC is what's important), get rid of the HTML formatting and
all these headers (anything outside the <pre> and </pre> tags), then use with
any ABC processing tool to hear and/or print the tunes.
Only the first verse (and chorus if applicable) is available here; check
http://www.sff.net/people/julia.west/filking.html for the rest of the lyrics to
these songs.
These are only a very few of the songs Cat Faber has written.

