E2C2 D2E2|"F"FEFG A2dc|"G7"B2G2 A2B2|"C"c4-c2:|]
This is a collection of tunes by Gavin Atkin of the English-style dance band Florida
email: gmatkin@clara.net
street address: 10 Western Road, Tunbridge Wells, Kent, TN1 2JJ
Of the tunes I have made, I think these are the best - but do please use them
for the sorts of dances they most suit. For example, The Homebrew and More Shed
are great for the Nottingham Swing, but just don't work if you try to play them
AABB!
Also, if you play them on an album or in a concert, please credit me. I hope you find these tunes useful and enjoyable.
Gavin Atkin

